+        "O(n^3) Gauss-Jordan elimination over GF(2), measured at 0.0096 seconds "
+        "and 632205 scalar bit operations per shipping instance; domain-standard "
+        "DPLL/unit propagation also succeeds at 0.0418 seconds and 295133 literal "
+        "evaluations, while hidden-cycle parallel-prefix inversion takes 108 exact "
+        "wide-word operations."
+    ),
+    "max_answer_tokens": 17,
+}
