+> **Status:** the generator is implemented and local gates G1--G8 pass, but this
+> result is not releasable yet. The mandatory bare, structural-hint, and placebo
+> oracle runs each aborted before a scored attempt because OpenRouter returned
+> HTTP 403 `Key limit exceeded (total limit)`. G9 is therefore correctly false;
+> the error transcripts are infrastructure evidence, not hardness evidence.
 
 | Profile field | Value |
 |---|---|
 | Track | **B -- no-tool compression** |
 | Native domain | combinatorics |
 | Object regime | finite discrete |
-| Computational core | CSP/SAT carried through the paper's PAFP graph reduction |
-| Certificate form | integer tuple / Boolean path choices, written as fixed-width hexadecimal |
