The deliverables are now internally consistent and audited. The only failing gate is G9, for the correct reason: the hinted oracle has zero scored attempts. All three transcript files contain four schema-valid HTTP 403 error records for the final rendered family, and the README explicitly warns that the module must not be submitted until quota is restored.
The generator, local measurements, README, and all transcript artifacts are complete. The external OpenRouter account limit prevented every scored bare/G9 oracle attempt, so final hardening remains pending and G9 is intentionally false.
