- Main module: [gen_1111_3996.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1111.3996/gen_1111_3996.py)
- Documentation: [README.md](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1111.3996/README.md)
- Gate evidence: [selftest_report.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1111.3996/selftest_report.json)
- Bare oracle transcript: [llm_loop_transcript.jsonl](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1111.3996/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl)
- G9 transcripts: [hinted](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1111.3996/g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl), [placebo](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1111.3996/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl)

Results:

- G1–G9 all pass.
- Shipping preset: `easy`, `n=127`.
- Guessing: 0/200,000; exact density \(2^{-127}\).
- Five attacks: 0/8 successes each.
- Bare, structural-hint, and placebo oracle arms: 0/3 each.
- Answer: 34 serialized characters, 127 semantic atoms.
- Intended compact route: 223 exact operations.
- Canonical-key testing: 80/80 invariance and carried-witness checks; 20/20 unrelated instances distinct.
